		<label>Norinco EM-356</label>
		<description>Caliber: 5.56x45mm NATO. 30-round detachable mag. Semi-Automatic.
		
The Norinco EM-356 is a semi-automatic copy of the Chinese Type 81 assault rifle converted to 5.56x45mm NATO, designed for civilian export. Such rifles are rather rare, having only been produced in small quantities relative to Norinco's other civilian products.</description>
